"], "title": "tick-hub kills only the gate's direct child, so EVERY gate can outlive its own report"}, {"id": "timerslack-cell-implement-from-completed-design", "landed": false, "owner": "hermit-012", "status": "CLOSED", "tags": ["implemented", "landed"], "title": "Implement the TIMERSLACK regression cell from agent(hermit-007)'s completed design \u2014 it ran out of context, not out of answers"}, {"id": "track-divergence-point-to-measure-less-red", "landed": false, "owner": "codex-hostload", "status": "CLOSED", "tags": ["implemented", "landed"], "title": "P1 OWNER IDEA: track SCHEDULER TURNS / VIRTUAL NS BEFORE THE DIVERGENCE POINT \u2014 so a red cell can get measurably LESS RED"}, {"id": "trawl-all-owner-directives-from-disk-and-hermit1db", "landed": false, "owner": "claude-reviewer", "status": "CLOSED", "tags": ["implemented"], "title": "P0 FIRST: trawl ALL owner prompts from this session AND hermit1.db \u2014 enumerate every directive as the audit's acceptance criteria"}, {"id": "triage_the_main_red", "landed": false, "owner": "hermit-triage", "status": "CLOSED", "tags": ["main-green", "triage", "validate", "dbt", "implemented"], "title": "Triage the main-red validate node set: it is not five independent causes \u2014 one is not a failure and two are the same DBT boundary"}, {"id": "twenty-one-steps-share-a-cargo-target-so-compile-work-migrates-between-them", "landed": false, "owner": "", "status": "BACKLOG", "tags": ["implemented"], "title": "Twenty-one steps share target/debug, so which node pays for a compile depends on which ran first"}, {"id": "two_demo_green_review", "landed": false, "owner": "", "status": "BACKLOG", "tags": ["bug", "demos", "implemented"], "title": "Two Demo-Green-Review trailers misstate what was reviewed, and the checker cannot detect either"}, {"id": "unboxed-mode-absent-from-durable-log-ledger-and-banner", "landed": false, "owner": "runner-termination", "status": "CLOSED", "tags": ["implemented"], "title": "P0: unboxed mode is ABSENT